-- proc-index/route predicate mismatch. The approved manifest records each
-- exact original route and polygon source; no destination is changed here.
-- NULL routes were absent from migration 65's client ownership ledger. Restore
-- client ownership only when restoring NULL geometry, so ordinary map movement
-- does not race the existing client's transition. Non-NULL routes retain owner.
